title Read Two Pages of an Append-only Timeline - Target
participant Caller
participant "History service" as Service
database "Session events" as DB
participant "Execution writer" as Writer
Caller -> Service : Request page 1 and limit
Service -> Service : Validate page, limit and offset
Service -> DB : Consistent read: authorize and query complete events
DB --> Service : Ordered records plus one lookahead
Service --> Caller : Events and nextPage
Writer -> DB : Append new complete events
DB --> Writer : Committed tail
Caller -> Service : Request next page with the same limit
Service -> DB : New consistent read; recheck authorization
alt Read remains authorized and valid
  DB --> Service : Ordered page, including any visible newer tail
  Service --> Caller : Events and nextPage
else Access revoked or projection invalid
  DB --> Service : Read failure
  Service --> Caller : Controlled error
end
note over Caller,DB
  No cross-page snapshot; no delta history.
  nextPage=null does not mean execution has completed.
end note
@enduml
